    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe team at Sherry FitzGerald Carroll delight in presenting number 40 Barrack Street to the market. This is an attractive residential investment opportunity in the heart of Dundalk. \n\nThe property comprises a well-configured 1 bedroom house with second internal room, and a 1-bedroom apartment, offering dual-income potential with strong rental demand from the local market.\n\nIdeally located within walking distance of Dundalk Town Centre, transport links, retail amenities, educational facilities, and major employers, the property is well positioned to appeal to a broad tenant base or potential end user who is seeking an interesting project to return to a single residence. Both units provide comfortable, modern accommodation.\n\nThe combination of a house and 1-bed unit allows investors to diversify rental income streams while benefiting from a single, easily managed asset. With continued demand for quality rental accommodation in Dundalk and the surrounding area, 40 Barrack Street offers the potential for stable income generation and long-term capital appreciation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nBasement - \n\n\nKitchen - 4.1m x 3.4m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.3m x 2.6m\n\n\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nLiving Room - 4.1m x 3.7m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom - 4.1m x 2.5m\n\n\nBedroom - 2.8m x 2.0m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.4m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA:806 sq.ft (74.9 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
